WEBVTT

00:07:58.396 --> 00:08:02.332
But at the same time, America's gone
through this crisis of isolation.

00:08:02.356 --> 00:08:06.321
So you've seen the number of people
who say no one understands them has risen,

00:08:06.345 --> 00:08:09.458
the number of people who say
they're chronically lonely has risen;

00:08:09.482 --> 00:08:11.634
55% of Americans say
no one knows them well.

00:08:11.658 --> 00:08:13.116
And so, in the last few years,

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:15.511
you've seen this spike up
in mental health issues,

00:08:15.535 --> 00:08:16.741
a spike up in depression,

00:08:16.765 --> 00:08:20.372
30% rise in suicide,
70% rise of teenage suicide.

00:08:20.396 --> 00:08:25.484
And so the whole country is going through
a crisis of disconnection and isolation,

00:08:25.508 --> 00:08:27.142
exactly as I was.

00:08:27.166 --> 00:08:29.152
And I just had maybe a little head start.

00:08:29.176 --> 00:08:32.283
So I spent six years thinking about,
"How do you get out of this?